Upstream inspiration
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Melodex's engineering structure — a shared Rust core with thin platform shells,
a platform-adapter trait, and a resumable download engine — is modeled on the
architecture of the HotDownloader project:

    HotDownloader
    https://github.com/lerdb/HotDownloader
    Copyright the HotDownloader contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

No HotDownloader source code is copied verbatim into this repository. The
architecture and the compliance conventions (LICENSE + NOTICE +
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES) are followed, as required by Section 4 of the License.

